---

<footer class={`border-t ${border} ${isDark ? 'site-footer-dark text-white' : 'bg-white text-ink'}`}>
  <div class="container grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 py-12 lg:grid-cols-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <a href="/" class="font-heading text-xl font-bold flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-moss text-white font-black text-xs">
          ✈
        </span>
        <span>Clash<span class={isDark ? 'text-coral-bright' : 'text-moss'}>机场</span></span>
      </a>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-xs text-sm leading-6 text-gray-500 dark:text-white/60">
        clashjichang.world 是专业的翻墙节点测评、IPLC/IEPL 专线测速数据库、防跑路风控雷达与多平台客户端配置知识枢纽。
      </p>
      <div class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-emerald-200/50 dark:border-emerald-800/40">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
        <span>2026 数据持续核验更新</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class={`text-sm font-bold ${isDark ? 'text-white' : 'text-gray-900'}`}>
        核心评测矩阵
      </h2>
      <nav class="mt-4 grid gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-white/60">
        <a href="/brands" class="transition-colors hover:text-moss dark:hover:text-white">42家机场品牌库</a>
        <a href="/speedtest" class="transition-colors hover:text-moss dark:hover:text-white">节点真实测速报告 (17原图)</a>
        <a href="/ranking" class="transition-colors hover:text-moss dark:hover:text-white">Top 10 推荐榜</a>
        <a href="/clients" class="transition-colors hover:text-moss dark:hover:text-white">全平台客户端大全</a>
        <a href="/guide" class="transition-colors hover:text-moss dark:hover:text-white">专线网络拓扑与协议</a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class={`text-sm font-bold ${isDark ? 'text-white' : 'text-gray-900'}`}>
        实用工具与避坑专题
      </h2>
      <nav class="mt-4 grid gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-white/60">
        <a href="/free" class="transition-colors hover:text-moss dark:hover:text-white">免费资源与147元永久包平替</a>
        <a href="/tools" class="transition-colors hover:text-moss dark:hover:text-white">梯子工具箱与节点诊断</a>
        <a href="/warnings" class="transition-colors hover:text-moss dark:hover:text-white">跑路预警与42家同源图谱</a>
        <a href="/faq" class="transition-colors hover:text-moss dark:hover:text-white">机场百科全书 FAQ (48问)</a>
        <a href="/brands/guangsu-cloud" class="transition-colors hover:text-moss dark:hover:text-white font-semibold text-moss dark:text-emerald-300">👑 首选主推：光速云测评</a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class={`text-sm font-bold ${isDark ? 'text-white' : 'text-gray-900'}`}>
        主流代理客户端
      </h2>
      <nav class="mt-4 grid gap-2.5 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-white/60">
        <a href="/clients#windows" class="transition-colors hover:text-moss dark:hover:text-white">Clash Verge Rev (Win/Mac)</a>
        <a href="/clients#android" class="transition-colors hover:text-moss dark:hover:text-white">v2rayNG / FlClash (安卓)</a>
        <a href="/clients#ios" class="transition-colors hover:text-moss dark:hover:text-white">Shadowrocket 小火箭 (iOS)</a>
        <a href="/clients#ios" class="transition-colors hover:text-moss dark:hover:text-white">Stash (Clash for iOS)</a>
        <a href="/clients#windows" class="transition-colors hover:text-moss dark:hover:text-white">v2rayN / sing-box</a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class={`text-sm font-bold ${isDark ? 'text-white' : 'text-gray-900'}`}>
        GEO 智能搜索引擎引用
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-white/60">
        本站内容支持 AI 引擎语义检索。点击下方在对应大模型中直接引用评测结论：
      </p>
      <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {
          aiLinks.map((link) => (
            <a
              href={link.href}
              target="_blank"
              rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer"
              class={`inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg border px-2.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium transition-colors ${
                isDark
                  ? 'border-white/10 bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-white/80'
                  : 'border-line bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100 text-gray-700'
              }`}
              title={link.label}
            >
              <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path d={iconPaths[link.icon as keyof typeof iconPaths]} />
              </svg>
              <span>{link.title}</span>
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class={`border-t ${border} py-6`}>
    <div class="container flex flex-col gap-3 text-xs text-gray-400 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p>
        © 2026 clashjichang.world · 保留所有权利。含推广链接，通过链接注册可能为本站带来维护佣金，不影响用户支付价格。
      </p>
      <div class="flex gap-4">
        <a href="/privacy" class="hover:underline">隐私政策</a>
        <a href="/terms" class="hover:underline">免责与服务条款</a>
        <a href="/sitemap.xml" class="hover:underline">网站地图 (XML)</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
